        "text": "TRADING CARDS\nVIEW ALL\nSHARE\n2025 Panini University of Texas NIL Trading Card Box (Hobby)\n\nSKU: 2-19736-20\n\nPRICE\n\n$100.00\n\n1\n\nLIMITED TO 20 QTY PER TRANSACTION\n\nAdd to cart\n\nCONFIGURATION\n\nLOOK FOR\n2 Autographs\n1 Prizm Camo\n1 Diamond Plate\n2 Panini Parallels\nper box, on average!\n6\n\nCARDS\n\nPER PACK\n\n6\n\nPACKS\n\nPER BOX\n\n20\n\nBOXES\n\nPER CASE\n\n*PRODUCT WILL SHIP IN THE CASE FORM FOR ORDERS CONTAINING 20 BOXES. ORDERS WILL NOT BE COMBINED.\n\nKEY ATHLETES\n\nSHIPPING & RETURNS\n\nPRODUCT DETAILS\n\n• Includes current student athletes of Men’s and Women’s sports programs. Also included are key Legends!\n• Pull unique Panini Prizm inserts such as Prizm Fearless, Prizm Fireworks and Prizm Student Orientation.\n• Look for colorful Parallels throughout the product.\n• Look for super-tough and scintillating SSP inserts such as Color Blast and On Campus. The SSP inserts Profiles and the ALL NEW Thunder can be found exclusive to Hobby. Also look for TWO randomly inserted autographs per box.\n• Look for the Super Short Print On Campus and Color Blast inserts!\n\nDownload checklist here\n\nAll information is accurate at the time of posting - content is subject to change.*\n\nRELATED PRODUCTS\n2025 Panini University of Texas NIL Trading Card Box (Blaster)\n\n2025 PANINI UNIVERSITY OF TEXAS NIL TRADING CARD BOX (BLASTER)\n\nPRICE\n\n$30.00\n\nAdd to cart\n2024-25 Panini University of Connecticut Collegiate Basketball Trading Card Box (Blaster)\n\n2024-25 PANINI UNIVERSITY OF CONNECTICUT COLLEGIATE BASKETBALL TRADING CARD BOX (BLASTER)\n\nPRICE\n\n$30.00\n\nAdd to cart\n2024 Panini Herky on Parade - 20th Anniversary Blaster Box\n\n2024 PANINI HERKY ON PARADE - 20TH ANNIVERSARY BLASTER BOX\n\nPRICE\n\n$29.99\n\nAdd to cart",
